\name{cellucid_layout_panel_float}
\alias{cellucid_layout_panel_float}
\title{Undock a section}
\usage{
cellucid_layout_panel_float(viewer, panel, height, left, top, width)
}
\arguments{
\item{viewer}{A viewer \code{\link{cellucid_view}()} or \code{\link{cellucid_serve}()} returned.}
\item{panel}{A sidebar section by its title (Visualization, Navigation, \ldots) or its id. Text (at least 1 character). Required.}
\item{height}{Height in CSS pixels (kept at least its header and first row). A number (more than 0). Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
\item{left}{Distance of its left edge from the left of the window, in CSS pixels. A number. Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
\item{top}{Distance of its top edge from the top of the window, in CSS pixels. A number. Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
\item{width}{Width in CSS pixels (kept at least its smallest working width). A number (more than 0). Left out unless given (the viewer then chooses as its own control does).}
}
\value{
A \code{cellucid_action_request}, at once and invisibly: the action is sent now, or when the viewer's channel opens.
\code{\link{cellucid_action_result}(request)} returns its outcome (what it did, as names, counts and ids), or \code{NULL} when it had nothing to report; \code{request$step} is the history step it made.
}
\description{
Tear a sidebar section off into a floating window, at a given place and size or beside the sidebar.
}
\details{
The viewer's action \code{layout.panel.float} (Layout). It changes the viewer's layout: one step of the viewer's history, labeled as R's, undone like any other. The state it can change: \code{layout}.
}
\seealso{
\code{\link{cellucid_act}()} sends any action by its type, and \code{\link{cellucid_action_result}()}
collects its answer.
}
\examples{
if (interactive() && requireNamespace("SeuratObject", quietly = TRUE)) {
  data("pbmc_small", package = "SeuratObject")
  viewer <- cellucid_view(SeuratObject::UpdateSeuratObject(pbmc_small))
  request <- cellucid_layout_panel_float(viewer, panel = "Visualization")
  print(request)
  # cellucid_action_result(request) waits for its outcome.
  cellucid_stop(viewer)
}
}
